# Global line-ending normalization, applied to every repository on this
# machine via `core.attributesFile` (see .gitconfig in this repo). This
# file lives at $HOME, outside any individual repo's working tree, so it
# can never be staged or committed into a repo - no injector function or
# unstage hook is needed. It only affects this machine's local view
# (diffs, checkouts); it does not rewrite blobs for other people cloning
# a given repo, so repos you maintain should still ship their own
# committed .gitattributes for collaborators (see e.g. WSL-Setup, and the
# per-repo .gitattributes fix in this very repo's history for why that's
# still necessary on top of this).
* text=auto eol=lf
